# German texts of Mitsuki's park scene (assets/mitsuki/park). Each line: "original" = "translation".
language de "Deutsch"

"The park" = "Der Park"
"MITSUKI!!" = "MITSUKI!!"
"You came... you actually came..." = "Du bist gekommen... du bist wirklich gekommen..."
"I said ten minutes. It was twelve." = "Ich sagte zehn Minuten. Es waren zwölf."
"I was so scared. They were everywhere..." = "Ich hatte solche Angst. Sie waren überall..."
"I know. You stayed put. You did well." = "Ich weiß. Du bist geblieben. Gut gemacht."
"Don't let go yet, okay?" = "Lass noch nicht los, ja?"
"...I won't. Come. Let's sit down." = "...Mach ich nicht. Komm. Setzen wir uns."
"Your hands are always so cold." = "Deine Hände sind immer so kalt."
"Yours are always warm. It evens out." = "Deine sind immer warm. Das gleicht sich aus."
"Hey... can I tell you something?" = "Du... kann ich dir was erzählen?"
"Mhm." = "Mhm."
"Ever since... that day, I can't sleep." = "Seit... jenem Tag kann ich nicht schlafen."
"Something sits on my chest at night." = "Nachts sitzt mir etwas auf der Brust."
"I thought if I said it out loud..." = "Ich dachte, wenn ich es ausspreche..."
"...Hina. Look at me." = "...Hina. Sieh mich an."
"It's here. It's always been here..." = "Es ist hier. Es war immer hier..."
"MITSUKIII!!" = "MITSUKIII!!"
"...Hina." = "...Hina."
"...Give her back." = "...Gib sie zurück."
